{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0a00000000000001","type":"group","x":0,"y":-650,"width":4560,"height":520,"label":"阅读入口","color":"5"},
		{"id":"0a00000000000002","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":1450,"height":650,"label":"① 同步阶段","color":"2"},
		{"id":"0a00000000000003","type":"group","x":1530,"y":0,"width":1450,"height":650,"label":"② 第一次微任务","color":"6"},
		{"id":"0a00000000000004","type":"group","x":3060,"y":0,"width":1500,"height":650,"label":"③ 定时器与后续微任务","color":"4"},
		{"id":"0a00000000000005","type":"group","x":0,"y":750,"width":2600,"height":940,"label":"回调返回值如何决定 P2","color":"3"},
		{"id":"0a00000000000006","type":"group","x":2700,"y":750,"width":1860,"height":940,"label":"重难点","color":"1"},
		{"id":"0a00000000000007","type":"group","x":0,"y":1790,"width":4560,"height":800,"label":"四句源码翻译","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b100000000000001","type":"file","x":2730,"y":-560,"width":760,"height":330,"file":"路线/知识点/进阶/Promise手撕/Promise 手撕思路.md"},
		{"id":"b200000000000001","type":"text","x":100,"y":-560,"width":2450,"height":330,"text":"# Promise `then`：P1、P2、P3 接力图\n\n**核心问题**\n\n- `then` 为什么一定返回一个新 Promise（P2）？\n- `resolveP2` 到底属于谁？\n- `P3.then(resolveP2, rejectP2)` 为什么能让 P2 跟随 P3？\n\n**阅读顺序**：先看上方 ①→②→③，再看返回值分支、重难点和底部四句翻译。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b200000000000002","type":"text","x":3600,"y":-560,"width":850,"height":330,"text":"## 一句话主线\n\nP1 提供 `10`\n\n→ 回调返回 P3\n\n→ P3 得到 `20`\n\n→ P2 跟随 P3 得到 `20`\n\n→ 下一个 `then` 打印 `20`","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b300000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":100,"width":380,"height":440,"text":"## 1. 创建 P1\n\n```js\nconst p1 = new MyPromise(resolveP1 => {\n  resolveP1(10)\n})\n```\n\n- `executor` 立即执行\n- `resolveP1` 只控制 P1\n- P1：`fulfilled`\n- P1.result：`10`","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b300000000000002","type":"text","x":540,"y":100,"width":400,"height":440,"text":"## 2. 调用 P1.then\n\n```js\nconst p2 = p1.then(firstCallback)\n```\n\n`then` 内部马上创建并返回 P2：\n\n```js\nnew MyPromise((resolveP2, rejectP2) => {})\n```\n\n- P2 初始：`pending`\n- 回调被安排进微任务\n- `resolveP2 / rejectP2` 只控制 P2","color":"2"},
		{"id":"b300000000000003","type":"text","x":1020,"y":100,"width":350,"height":440,"text":"## 3. 调用 P2.then\n\n```js\np2.then(secondCallback)\n```\n\n此时 P2 还没有结果：\n\n- P2.state：`pending`\n- `secondCallback` 暂存进 P2.callbacks\n- 保存的是“将来怎么处理”的函数，不是异步结果","color":"6"},
		{"id":"b400000000000001","type":"text","x":1610,"y":100,"width":370,"height":440,"text":"## 4. 执行 firstCallback\n\n```js\nconst result = onFulfilled(P1.result)\n```\n\n等价于：\n\n```js\nconst result = onFulfilled(10)\n```\n\n第一次值传递：\n\n`P1.result → 回调参数 value`","color":"6"},
		{"id":"b400000000000002","type":"text","x":2060,"y":100,"width":370,"height":440,"text":"## 5. 回调创建并返回 P3\n\n```js\nreturn new MyPromise(resolveP3 => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    resolveP3(value * 2)\n  }, 1000)\n})\n```\n\n- P3 的 executor 立即注册定时器\n- P3 当前：`pending`\n- 局部变量 `result === P3`","color":"2"},
		{"id":"b400000000000003","type":"text","x":2510,"y":100,"width":390,"height":440,"text":"## 6. P2 把控制权交给 P3\n\n```js\nP3.then(resolveP2, rejectP2)\n```\n\n等价于：\n\n```js\nP3.then(\n  value => resolveP2(value),\n  reason => rejectP2(reason)\n)\n```\n\nP3 尚未完成，所以先保存这两个接力函数；P2 继续 `pending`。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"b500000000000001","type":"text","x":3140,"y":100,"width":370,"height":440,"text":"## 7. 一秒后 P3 成功\n\n```js\nresolveP3(value * 2)\nresolveP3(20)\n```\n\n- P3.state：`fulfilled`\n- P3.result：`20`\n- 开始执行 P3 中保存的成功处理函数","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b500000000000002","type":"text","x":3590,"y":100,"width":370,"height":440,"text":"## 8. P3 解决 P2\n\nP3 保存的成功回调就是 `resolveP2`：\n\n```js\nresolveP2(P3.result)\nresolveP2(20)\n```\n\n于是：\n\n- P2.state：`fulfilled`\n- P2.result：`20`","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b500000000000003","type":"text","x":4040,"y":100,"width":430,"height":440,"text":"## 9. 执行第二个 then\n\nP2 成功后，执行先前暂存的回调：\n\n```js\nsecondCallback(P2.result)\nsecondCallback(20)\n```\n\n最终：\n\n```text\nconsole.log(20)\n```","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b600000000000001","type":"text","x":90,"y":870,"width":500,"height":680,"text":"## 核心判断\n\n```js\nconst result = callback(this.result)\n\nif (result instanceof MyPromise) {\n  result.then(resolveP2, rejectP2)\n} else {\n  resolveP2(result)\n}\n```\n\n若回调抛异常：\n\n```js\ncatch (error) {\n  rejectP2(error)\n}\n```\n\n**不是 P1 直接决定 P2，而是用户回调的执行结果决定 P2。**","color":"3"},
		{"id":"b600000000000002","type":"text","x":760,"y":820,"width":760,"height":180,"text":"## 返回普通值\n\n`return 20` → `resolveP2(20)` → P2 fulfilled，结果为 `20`","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b600000000000003","type":"text","x":760,"y":1040,"width":760,"height":180,"text":"## 没有 return\n\n函数默认返回 `undefined` → `resolveP2(undefined)` → P2 fulfilled","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b600000000000004","type":"text","x":760,"y":1260,"width":760,"height":180,"text":"## 抛出异常\n\n`throw error` → 被 `catch` 捕获 → `rejectP2(error)` → P2 rejected","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b600000000000005","type":"text","x":760,"y":1480,"width":760,"height":160,"text":"## 返回 P3\n\n`P3.then(resolveP2, rejectP2)`：P3 成功/失败/等待，P2 就跟着成功/失败/等待","color":"6"},
		{"id":"b600000000000006","type":"text","x":1650,"y":910,"width":830,"height":600,"text":"## P3 分支结果\n\n**P3 成功**\n\n`resolveP3(20)` → 调用 `resolveP2(20)` → P2 fulfilled\n\n**P3 失败**\n\n`rejectP3(error)` → 调用 `rejectP2(error)` → P2 rejected\n\n**P3 永远 pending**\n\nP2 也一直 pending，后面的 `then` 不执行\n\n> 接力的本质：把控制 P2 的两个函数，作为 P3 的成功/失败回调传进去。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"b700000000000001","type":"text","x":2780,"y":850,"width":520,"height":230,"text":"## 1. 三个 resolve 不是同一个函数\n\n- `resolveP1` 控制 P1\n- `resolveP2` 控制 P2\n- `resolveP3` 控制 P3\n\n名字相同不代表身份相同；看它由哪个 Promise 的 executor 接收到。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b700000000000002","type":"text","x":3370,"y":850,"width":520,"height":230,"text":"## 2. 两次值传递\n\n第一次：`P1.result → callback(value)`\n\n第二次：`callback 的返回值 result → P2.result`\n\n不要误认为旧 Promise 的结果会直接变成新 Promise 的结果。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b700000000000003","type":"text","x":3960,"y":850,"width":520,"height":230,"text":"## 3. executor 与 then 回调\n\n- `new MyPromise(executor)`：executor 立即执行\n- `then` 的用户回调：由 `queueMicrotask` 安排，稍后执行\n\n创建 P2 是同步的，执行 firstCallback 是异步微任务。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b700000000000004","type":"text","x":2780,"y":1160,"width":520,"height":310,"text":"## 4. pending 为什么保存 callbacks\n\nPromise 还没有真实结果，也不知道会成功还是失败，只能先登记：\n\n- 成功后做什么\n- 失败后做什么\n\n`callbacks` 保存函数；真实值最终放在 `this.result`。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b700000000000005","type":"text","x":3370,"y":1160,"width":520,"height":310,"text":"## 5. this 指向调用 then 的 Promise\n\n第一次：\n\n`P1.then(...)` → `this === P1`\n\n接力时：\n\n`P3.then(...)` → `this === P3`\n\n内部箭头函数沿用外层 `then` 的 `this`。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b700000000000006","type":"text","x":3960,"y":1160,"width":520,"height":390,"text":"## 6. 教学版实现的边界\n\n当前 `resolve` 只是简单保存值，所以不能指望 `resolveP2(P3)` 自动等待 P3，才手动写：\n\n`P3.then(resolveP2, rejectP2)`\n\n完整 Promise 解析还要处理：\n\n- thenable\n- 循环引用\n- 多层嵌套\n- 原生 Promise 兼容","color":"1"},
		{"id":"b800000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":1890,"width":980,"height":370,"text":"## ① 创建 P2\n\n```js\nreturn new MyPromise((resolve, reject) => {})\n```\n\n翻译：创建并返回 P2；这里的 `resolve`、`reject` 专门控制 P2。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b800000000000002","type":"text","x":1150,"y":1890,"width":980,"height":370,"text":"## ② 执行回调\n\n```js\nconst result = callback(this.result)\n```\n\n翻译：把旧 Promise 的结果传给用户回调，并接住用户回调的返回值。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b800000000000003","type":"text","x":2220,"y":1890,"width":980,"height":370,"text":"## ③ 普通值解决 P2\n\n```js\nresolve(result)\n```\n\n翻译：用户回调返回普通值，就用这个值让 P2 成功。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b800000000000004","type":"text","x":3290,"y":1890,"width":1180,"height":370,"text":"## ④ P3 接管 P2\n\n```js\nresult.then(resolve, reject)\n```\n\n翻译：若 `result` 是 P3，就让 P3 成功时调用 `resolveP2`、失败时调用 `rejectP2`，因此 P2 跟随 P3。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"b800000000000005","type":"text","x":850,"y":2320,"width":2860,"height":180,"text":"# 最终记忆\n\n`then` 先把 P1 的结果交给用户回调；普通返回值直接解决 P2，返回 P3 就让 P3 通过 `resolveP2 / rejectP2` 决定 P2。","color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
